    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "install-needs-app",
      "lines": [
        "Nextcloud 33.0.11 on PHP 8.5.13: the app needs the app of OCA\\Shared, which the test server does not have, and info.xml has no way to name it.",
        "  OCA\\Shared: no app of the App Store has an id that namespace stands for.",
        "  What it causes is not reported on its own:",
        "    install-log-errors: the server logs 3 entries of level 3 or higher that name the app.",
        "  The entries behind it:",
        "    error (PHP): Error: Class \"OCA\\Shared\\Services\\UserFilesService\" not found at /var/www/html/custom_apps/investments/lib/AppInfo/Application.php#69"
